Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 09:24:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] common, server: reasoning-budget nudge

A nudge forced mid-reasoning at the first newline after nudge_at x the
reasoning budget (common_params_sampling::reasoning_budget_nudge,
reasoning_budget_nudge_at, default 0.8), exposed through the server schema,
with tests in test-reasoning-budget and test-chat.

Exported read-only from the uncommitted working tree of
a local checkout of sudoingX/llama.cpp (branch bonsai2) against base
285542d98d37d0f07f491cd206aefa31f1848f33 (git diff), 2026-09-25.
